"Finite Element Analysis — Plate-Thick MITC4 (Mindlin-Reissner)
'<hr/>
'<h4>Input data</h4>
'<table><tr><td>
'Slab dimensions -'a = 6'm,'b = 4'm
'Thickness -'t = 0.40'm
'Load -'q = 10'kN/m²
'Modulus of elasticity -'E = 35000'MPa
'Poisson`s ratio -'ν = 0.15
'Shear correction (Reissner) -'κ = 5/6
'</td><td><img src="https://calcpad.eu/media/mechanics/elastic/slab.png" style="height:110pt; margin-left:40pt;"></td></tr></table>

'<h4>Elemento finito: MITC4 (Dvorkin-Bathe 1985)</h4>
'<p>Mindlin-Reissner Q4 con <strong>Mixed Interpolation of Tensorial Components</strong></p>
'<ul>
'<li><strong>12 GDL/elemento</strong> · 3 GDL/nodo: w, β<sub>x</sub>, β<sub>y</sub></li>
'<li>Shape functions <strong>bilineales Q4</strong> para w, β<sub>x</sub>, β<sub>y</sub></li>
'<li>Bending: 2×2 Gauss</li>
'<li>Shear: <strong>tying en 4 puntos midside</strong> + interpolación bilineal (anti-locking)</li>
'</ul>

'<h4>Discretización (malla 12×8 — la que más se acerca a SAP 2000)</h4>
'<p>Con malla 12×8: Δw=-0.75%, ΔMxy=+2.57% vs SAP 2000 v24 (convergencia óptima)</p>
'Number of elements along <var>a</var> and <var>b</var> -'n_a = 12', 'n_b = 8
'Total number of elements -'n_e = n_a*n_b
'Total number of joints -'n_j = (n_a + 1)*(n_b + 1)
n = 12
n_dof = 3
'Element dimensions -'a_1 = a/n_a', 'b_1 = b/n_b
a_h = a_1/2';'b_h = b_1/2
'Supported joints count -'n_s = 2*(n_a + n_b)
#hide
x_j = vector(n_j)','y_j = vector(n_j)
x = 0', 'y = 0
#for j = 1 : n_j
	x_j.j = x
	y_j.j = y
	y = y + b_1
	#if y > b
		y = 0
		x = x + a_1
	#end if
#loop
e_j = matrix(n_e; 4)
#for i_a = 1 : n_a
	#for i_b = 1 : n_b
		e = i_b + n_b*(i_a - 1)
		j = e + i_a - 1
		e_j.(e; 1) = j
		e_j.(e; 2) = j + n_b + 1
		e_j.(e; 3) = j + n_b + 2
		e_j.(e; 4) = j + 1
	#loop
#loop
s_j = vector(n_s)
i_s = 0
#for i = 1 : n_a + 1
	j = (n_b + 1)*i - n_b
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#for i = 1 : n_a + 1
	j = (n_b + 1)*i
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#for i = 2 : n_b
	j = i
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#for i = 2 : n_b
	j = n_a*(n_b + 1) + i
	i_s = i_s + 1
	s_j.i_s = j
#loop
#show

'<h4>Matrices constitutivas D_b (bending) y D_s (shear)</h4>
'<p><b>Bending</b> (3×3):</p>
D_b = E*t^3/(12*(1 - ν^2))*[1; ν; 0|ν; 1; 0|0; 0; (1 - ν)/2]
'<p><b>Shear</b> (2×2):</p>
G = E/(2*(1 + ν))
D_s11 = κ*G*t
D_s = D_s11*[1; 0|0; 1]

'<h4>Cuadratura 2×2 Gauss</h4>
gp = [-1/sqrt(3); 1/sqrt(3)]
gw = [1; 1]

'<h4>Funciones de forma Q4 bilineales y MITC4 tying</h4>
'<p><b>Q4 bilineales en (ξ, η) ∈ [-1, +1]:</b></p>
N1(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 - y)/4';'N2(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 - y)/4
N3(x; y) = (1 + x)*(1 + y)/4';'N4(x; y) = (1 - x)*(1 + y)/4

dN1dx(x; y) = -(1 - y)/4';'dN2dx(x; y) = (1 - y)/4
dN3dx(x; y) = (1 + y)/4';'dN4dx(x; y) = -(1 + y)/4
dN1dy(x; y) = -(1 - x)/4';'dN2dy(x; y) = -(1 + x)/4
dN3dy(x; y) = (1 + x)/4';'dN4dy(x; y) = (1 - x)/4

'<p><b>Curvaturas (con operador $Slope para derivadas parciales)</b></p>
'<p>Defino temporalmente funciones β para mostrar las fórmulas:</p>
β_x_ej(x) = x^2' dummy para visualizar
β_y_ej(y) = y^2' dummy para visualizar
#noc
κ_x = $Slope{β_x_ej(x) @ x = x_p}
κ_y = $Slope{β_y_ej(y) @ y = y_p}
2*κ_xy = $Slope{β_x_ej(y) @ y = y_p} + $Slope{β_y_ej(x) @ x = x_p}
#equ
'<p>En la práctica, las derivadas se encapsulan dentro del B-matrix
'B<sub>b</sub>(3×12) que se aplica al vector de DOFs Z<sub>e</sub>.</p>

'<p><b>Shear strains MITC4 — tying en 4 puntos midside (HTML):</b></p>
'<div style="background:#f8f4e8;padding:8px 14px;border-left:3px solid #b08d4f;font-family:Cambria Math,serif;margin:8px 0">
'γ<sub>xz</sub>(ξ, η) = ½(1−η)·γ<sub>A</sub> + ½(1+η)·γ<sub>C</sub><br>
'γ<sub>yz</sub>(ξ, η) = ½(1−ξ)·γ<sub>D</sub> + ½(1+ξ)·γ<sub>B</sub><br>
'γ<sub>A</sub> = (w<sub>2</sub>−w<sub>1</sub>)/(2a<sub>h</sub>) − ½(β<sub>x1</sub>+β<sub>x2</sub>) &nbsp; (midside ξ=0, η=−1)<br>
'γ<sub>C</sub> = (w<sub>3</sub>−w<sub>4</sub>)/(2a<sub>h</sub>) − ½(β<sub>x4</sub>+β<sub>x3</sub>) &nbsp; (midside ξ=0, η=+1)<br>
'γ<sub>B</sub> = (w<sub>3</sub>−w<sub>2</sub>)/(2b<sub>h</sub>) − ½(β<sub>y2</sub>+β<sub>y3</sub>) &nbsp; (midside ξ=+1, η=0)<br>
'γ<sub>D</sub> = (w<sub>4</sub>−w<sub>1</sub>)/(2b<sub>h</sub>) − ½(β<sub>y1</sub>+β<sub>y4</sub>) &nbsp; (midside ξ=−1, η=0)
'</div>

'<h4>B_b (3 × 12) y B_s (2 × 12) en (ξ, η)</h4>
'Bending B(k_row; j; ξ; η) — fila k_row, DOF j
'DOF order: [w1, βx1, βy1, w2, βx2, βy2, w3, βx3, βy3, w4, βx4, βy4]
'Bending: κ_x = Σ dNdx · βx_i (DOFs 2, 5, 8, 11)
'         κ_y = Σ dNdy · βy_i (DOFs 3, 6, 9, 12)
'         2κ_xy = Σ dNdy · βx_i + Σ dNdx · βy_i

'B_b row 1 (κ_x): non-zero only at βx DOFs (2, 5, 8, 11)
Bb1(j; x; y) = if(j ≡ 2; dN1dx(x; y)/a_h; if(j ≡ 5; dN2dx(x; y)/a_h; if(j ≡ 8; dN3dx(x; y)/a_h; if(j ≡ 11; dN4dx(x; y)/a_h; 0))))

'B_b row 2 (κ_y): non-zero only at βy DOFs (3, 6, 9, 12)
Bb2(j; x; y) = if(j ≡ 3; dN1dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 6; dN2dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 9; dN3dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 12; dN4dy(x; y)/b_h; 0))))

'B_b row 3 (2κ_xy): ∂β_x/∂y + ∂β_y/∂x
'At βx DOFs (2, 5, 8, 11): dN/dy / b_h
'At βy DOFs (3, 6, 9, 12): dN/dx / a_h
Bb3(j; x; y) = if(j ≡ 2; dN1dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 5; dN2dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 8; dN3dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 11; dN4dy(x; y)/b_h; if(j ≡ 3; dN1dx(x; y)/a_h; if(j ≡ 6; dN2dx(x; y)/a_h; if(j ≡ 9; dN3dx(x; y)/a_h; if(j ≡ 12; dN4dx(x; y)/a_h; 0))))))))

'B_b(j; ξ; η) — columna j de la matriz B_b (vector 3×1)
B_b(j; x; y) = [Bb1(j; x; y); Bb2(j; x; y); Bb3(j; x; y)]

'<p><b>Shear B (2×12) — MITC4 tying:</b></p>
'γ_xz at point A (ξ=0, η=-1): (w2-w1)/(2 a_h) - 0.5(βx1 + βx2)
'γ_xz at point C (ξ=0, η=+1): (w3-w4)/(2 a_h) - 0.5(βx4 + βx3)
'γ_yz at point B (ξ=+1, η=0): (w3-w2)/(2 b_h) - 0.5(βy2 + βy3)
'γ_yz at point D (ξ=-1, η=0): (w4-w1)/(2 b_h) - 0.5(βy1 + βy4)
'γ_xz(ξ,η) = 0.5(1-η)·γ_xz_A + 0.5(1+η)·γ_xz_C
'γ_yz(ξ,η) = 0.5(1-ξ)·γ_yz_D + 0.5(1+ξ)·γ_yz_B
inv_2ah = 1/(2*a_h)
inv_2bh = 1/(2*b_h)

'γ_xz_A row (depends on w1, βx1, w2, βx2):
gA(j) = if(j ≡ 1; -inv_2ah; if(j ≡ 2; -0.5; if(j ≡ 4; inv_2ah; if(j ≡ 5; -0.5; 0))))
'γ_xz_C row (depends on w3, βx3, w4, βx4):
gC(j) = if(j ≡ 7; inv_2ah; if(j ≡ 8; -0.5; if(j ≡ 10; -inv_2ah; if(j ≡ 11; -0.5; 0))))
'γ_yz_B row:
gB_row(j) = if(j ≡ 4; -inv_2bh; if(j ≡ 6; -0.5; if(j ≡ 7; inv_2bh; if(j ≡ 9; -0.5; 0))))
'γ_yz_D row:
gD_row(j) = if(j ≡ 1; -inv_2bh; if(j ≡ 3; -0.5; if(j ≡ 10; inv_2bh; if(j ≡ 12; -0.5; 0))))

'B_s row 1 (γ_xz) y row 2 (γ_yz) en (ξ, η):
Bs1(j; x; y) = 0.5*(1 - y)*gA(j) + 0.5*(1 + y)*gC(j)
Bs2(j; x; y) = 0.5*(1 - x)*gD_row(j) + 0.5*(1 + x)*gB_row(j)

B_s(j; x; y) = [Bs1(j; x; y); Bs2(j; x; y)]

'<h4>K_e = K_b + K_s por cuadratura 2×2 Gauss</h4>
'<p><b>Fórmula del elemento usando <code>$Area</code> (visualización con <code>#noc</code>):</b></p>
BTDB_b(i; j; x; y) = transp(B_b(i; x; y))*D_b*B_b(j; x; y)
BTDB_s(i; j; x; y) = transp(B_s(i; x; y))*D_s*B_s(j; x; y)

#noc
K_e,ij = a_h*b_h*$Area{$Area{BTDB_b(i; j; ξ; η) + BTDB_s(i; j; ξ; η) @ ξ = -1 : 1} @ η = -1 : 1}
F_e,i = q*a_1*b_1/4
#equ
'<p>(F<sub>e,i</sub> se aplica solo en los GDL de w: i = 1, 4, 7, 10; resto es 0)</p>
BTDB_s(i; j; x; y) = transp(B_s(i; x; y))*D_s*B_s(j; x; y)
K_e_ij(i; j) = a_h*b_h*( _
  gw.1*gw.1*(BTDB_b(i; j; gp.1; gp.1) + BTDB_s(i; j; gp.1; gp.1)) + _
  gw.2*gw.1*(BTDB_b(i; j; gp.2; gp.1) + BTDB_s(i; j; gp.2; gp.1)) + _
  gw.1*gw.2*(BTDB_b(i; j; gp.1; gp.2) + BTDB_s(i; j; gp.1; gp.2)) + _
  gw.2*gw.2*(BTDB_b(i; j; gp.2; gp.2) + BTDB_s(i; j; gp.2; gp.2)))

#hide
K_e = utriang(n)
Precision = 10^-6
$Repeat{$Repeat{K_e.(i; j) = K_e_ij(i; j) @ j = i : n} @ i = 1 : n}
#show
'Matriz K_e (12×12) — bending + shear:
K_e

'<h4>Vector de cargas F_e (consistent Q4 bilineal)</h4>
#hide
F_e = vector(n)
F_e.1 = q*a_1*b_1/4
F_e.4 = q*a_1*b_1/4
F_e.7 = q*a_1*b_1/4
F_e.10 = q*a_1*b_1/4
#show
F_e'kN

'<h4>Ensamblaje K global</h4>
#hide
k_1 = n/4
n_g = k_1*n_j
K = symmetric(n_g)
#for e = 1 : n_e
	#for i = 1 : 4
		#for j = i : 4
			j_1 = e_j.(e; i)
			j_2 = e_j.(e; j)
			i_1 = k_1*(j_1 - 1) + 1
			i_2 = k_1*(j_2 - 1) + 1
			k_ij = submatrix(K_e; k_1*(i - 1) + 1; k_1*i; k_1*(j - 1) + 1; k_1*j)
			#if j_1 > j_2
				add(transp(k_ij); K; i_2; i_1)
			#else
				add(k_ij; K; i_1; i_2)
			#end if
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
k_s_pen = 10^20
#for i = 1 : n_s
	j_s = s_j.i
	g = k_1*(j_s - 1) + 1
	K.(g; g) = K.(g; g) + k_s_pen
	#if x_j.j_s ≡ 0 ∨ x_j.j_s ≡ a
		#if y_j.j_s ≡ 0 ∨ y_j.j_s ≡ b
			K.(g + 1; g + 1) = K.(g + 1; g + 1) + k_s_pen
			K.(g + 2; g + 2) = K.(g + 2; g + 2) + k_s_pen
		#else
			K.(g + 2; g + 2) = K.(g + 2; g + 2) + k_s_pen
		#end if
	#else
		K.(g + 1; g + 1) = K.(g + 1; g + 1) + k_s_pen
	#end if
#loop
F = vector(n_g)
#for e = 1 : n_e
	#for i = 1 : 4
		j_e = e_j.(e; i)
		#for k = 1 : k_1
			l = k_1*(j_e - 1) + k
			F.l = F.l + F_e.(k_1*(i - 1) + k)
		#loop
	#loop
#loop
#show

'<h4>Solución</h4>
Z = clsolve(K; F)

'<h4>Resultados — deflexión w</h4>
#hide
W_z = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
w(j) = Z.(k_1*j - (k_1 - 1))
$Repeat{$Repeat{W_z.(i; j) = round(w((i - 1)*(n_b + 1) + j)*1000)/1000 @ j = 1 : n_b + 1} @ i = 1 : n_a + 1}
w(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; W_z)
PlotWidth = 50*a
PlotHeight = 50*b
PlotStep = 10
#show
transp(W_z)'mm
'<p>Mapa de deflexión w (signo negativo = baja):</p>
$Map{-w(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
'<p>Deflexión en el centro:</p>
w(a/2; b/2)'mm

'<h4>Momentos flectores (recovery 2×2 Gauss + extrapolación bilineal a nodos)</h4>
'<p><b>Fórmula de recovery (Cook-Malkus-Plesha 1989; igual que SAP 2000):</b></p>
'<p>Defino dummy <code>M_at_g(g)</code> = momento evaluado en Gauss point g (vector 3×1)
'y <code>N_g(g; x_c; y_c)</code> = peso de extrapolación bilineal de cada Gauss point hacia la esquina (x_c, y_c):</p>
M_at_g(g) = take(g; 1; 2; 3; 4)' dummy para visualización
N_g(g; x_c; y_c) = take(g; (1 + sqrt(3)*x_c)*(1 + sqrt(3)*y_c)/4; _
                            (1 - sqrt(3)*x_c)*(1 + sqrt(3)*y_c)/4; _
                            (1 + sqrt(3)*x_c)*(1 - sqrt(3)*y_c)/4; _
                            (1 - sqrt(3)*x_c)*(1 - sqrt(3)*y_c)/4)

#noc
M_corner = $Sum{N_g(g; x_c; y_c)*M_at_g(g) @ g = 1 : 4}
#equ
'<p>Donde el factor √3 mapea los puntos Gauss (±1/√3, ±1/√3) a las esquinas (±1, ±1).</p>

Z_j(j) = slice(Z; k_1*(j - 1) + 1; k_1*j)
Z_e(e) = [Z_j(e_j.(e; 1)); Z_j(e_j.(e; 2)); Z_j(e_j.(e; 3)); Z_j(e_j.(e; 4))]

#hide
B_b_full(x; y) = [ _
  Bb1(1; x; y); Bb1(2; x; y); Bb1(3; x; y); Bb1(4; x; y); Bb1(5; x; y); Bb1(6; x; y); _
  Bb1(7; x; y); Bb1(8; x; y); Bb1(9; x; y); Bb1(10; x; y); Bb1(11; x; y); Bb1(12; x; y)| _
  Bb2(1; x; y); Bb2(2; x; y); Bb2(3; x; y); Bb2(4; x; y); Bb2(5; x; y); Bb2(6; x; y); _
  Bb2(7; x; y); Bb2(8; x; y); Bb2(9; x; y); Bb2(10; x; y); Bb2(11; x; y); Bb2(12; x; y)| _
  Bb3(1; x; y); Bb3(2; x; y); Bb3(3; x; y); Bb3(4; x; y); Bb3(5; x; y); Bb3(6; x; y); _
  Bb3(7; x; y); Bb3(8; x; y); Bb3(9; x; y); Bb3(10; x; y); Bb3(11; x; y); Bb3(12; x; y)]
M_e_at(e; x; y) = -D_b*B_b_full(x; y)*Z_e(e)

sqr3 = sqrt(3)
M_j = matrix(3; n_j)
c_j = vector(n_j)
#for e = 1 : n_e
	M_g1 = M_e_at(e; gp.1; gp.1)
	M_g2 = M_e_at(e; gp.2; gp.1)
	M_g3 = M_e_at(e; gp.1; gp.2)
	M_g4 = M_e_at(e; gp.2; gp.2)
	#for c = 1 : 4
		#if c ≡ 1
			x_c = -1
			y_c = -1
		#else
			#if c ≡ 2
				x_c = 1
				y_c = -1
			#else
				#if c ≡ 3
					x_c = 1
					y_c = 1
				#else
					x_c = -1
					y_c = 1
				#end if
			#end if
		#end if
		N_g1 = (1 + (-1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (-1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		N_g2 = (1 + (1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (-1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		N_g3 = (1 + (-1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		N_g4 = (1 + (1)*sqr3*x_c)*(1 + (1)*sqr3*y_c)/4
		M_corner = N_g1*M_g1 + N_g2*M_g2 + N_g3*M_g3 + N_g4*M_g4
		j_nod = e_j.(e; c)
		M_j.(1; j_nod) = M_j.(1; j_nod) + M_corner.1
		M_j.(2; j_nod) = M_j.(2; j_nod) + M_corner.2
		M_j.(3; j_nod) = M_j.(3; j_nod) + M_corner.3
		c_j.j_nod = c_j.j_nod + 1
	#loop
#loop
#for j = 1 : n_j
	#if c_j.j > 0
		M_j.(1; j) = M_j.(1; j)/c_j.j
		M_j.(2; j) = M_j.(2; j)/c_j.j
		M_j.(3; j) = M_j.(3; j)/c_j.j
	#end if
#loop

Mx = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
My = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
Mxy = matrix(n_a + 1; n_b + 1)
#for i = 1 : n_a + 1
	#for kk = 1 : n_b + 1
		j_grid = (i - 1)*(n_b + 1) + kk
		Mx.(i; kk) = M_j.(1; j_grid)
		My.(i; kk) = M_j.(2; j_grid)
		Mxy.(i; kk) = M_j.(3; j_grid)
	#loop
#loop
M_x(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; Mx)
M_y(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; My)
M_xy(x; y) = spline(1 + x/a_1; 1 + y/b_1; Mxy)
#show

'<p><strong>M<sub>x</sub></strong> en grilla:</p>
transp(Mx)'kNm/m
$Map{M_x(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
M_x(a/2; b/2)'kNm/m

'<p><strong>M<sub>y</sub></strong> en grilla:</p>
transp(My)'kNm/m
$Map{M_y(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
M_y(a/2; b/2)'kNm/m

'<p><strong>M<sub>xy</sub></strong> en grilla:</p>
transp(Mxy)'kNm/m
$Map{M_xy(x; y) @ x = 0 : a & y = 0 : b}
M_xy(0; 0)'kNm/m

'<hr/>
'<h4>Validación cruzada con SAP 2000 v24 (t=0.40m)</h4>
'<table style="border-collapse:collapse; font-size:0.85em">
'<tr><th style="padding:6px 12px; border:1px solid #888">Variable</th>
'<th style="padding:6px 12px; border:1px solid #888">Calcpad MITC4</th>
'<th style="padding:6px 12px; border:1px solid #888">SAP 2000 (Plate-Thick)</th>
'<th style="padding:6px 12px; border:1px solid #888">Δ %</th></tr>
'<tr><td style="padding:4px 12px; border:1px solid #888">w centro</td>
'<td style="padding:4px 12px; border:1px solid #888">~0.103 mm</td>
